//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Phil777 + Mystery overrides
//
// Reuses the luxe alias frames RUNE_ALT_HIGH (wide @-frame) and RUNE_HIGH (narrow
// @-frame) directly — the upstream rename to "%PURPLE%Big Mystery" / "%PURPLE%Lil
// Mystery" sets a PURPLE that overrides the alias's inner %RED% on the name, and
// the alias bodies carry no SOUNDID, so these items render silently in the mystery
// frame:
//   rtp (Navigator), rid (Almanac), rkey (Skeleton Key)        — BIG MYSTERY frame
//   lsvl (Vial of Lightsong), llmr (Lilith's Mirror)            — BIG MYSTERY frame
//   Runes Sur/Ber/Jah/Cham/Zod (RUNE>28)                        — BIG MYSTERY frame
//   lbox (PBOX / Puzzle Box)                                    — LIL MYSTERY frame
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ItemDisplay[RUNE>28 !(MAPID=1 OR MAPID=40 OR MAPID=75 OR MAPID=103 OR MAPID=109)]: %PURPLE%Big Mystery%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[RUNE>28 !(MAPID=1 OR MAPID=40 OR MAPID=75 OR MAPID=103 OR MAPID=109)]: %RUNE_ALT_HIGH%{%NAME%}

ItemDisplay[RUNE>25 RUNE<29 !(MAPID=1 OR MAPID=40 OR MAPID=75 OR MAPID=103 OR MAPID=109)]: %PURPLE%Lil Mystery%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[RUNE>25 RUNE<29 !(MAPID=1 OR MAPID=40 OR MAPID=75 OR MAPID=103 OR MAPID=109)]: %RUNE_HIGH%{%NAME%}


